{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkshLKYo4utuufLuzUbD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm putting together what I'd tell my son.\n\n**Thinking aloud, screen by screen**\n\n- Screen 1: It's black, with light letters. \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\". Fine, that's what I came for.\n- There's a yellow-brown box: \"נתוני הרשות לא עודכנו מאז ספטמבר 2026\". So the numbers are old? That makes me a bit uneasy.\n- The buttons say \"קופת גמל להשקעה 143\". 143 tracks? Oy.\n- Next row: \"עוקב מדד s&p 500\", \"עוקב מדד מניות\", \"כספי (שקלי)\", \"אג\"ח ממשלתי סחיר 1\". I know government bonds, so that one might be for me. I don't press it, though. I'm not sure what pressing does.\n- The table goes by company. \"הראל\" first, which I know. \"דמי ניהול ממוצע… מהחיסכון 0.54%… מההפקדה 0%\". 0.54% a year? I think that's what the bank charges too. I don't know.\n- \"תשואה שנתית ממוצעת, לפני דמי ניהול\". Many rows say \"פחות מ־3 שנים\". So no number? And next to it are little circles, yellow and turquoise, with \"מניות\" and \"מט\"ח\". I don't understand the circles.\n- \"מניות 13.7% 3 שנים\". The first big number I see is \"24.04%\" next to \"מניות\". That's shares, gambling. Not for me.\n- Screen 2: \"מור\", which I don't know. \"כספי (שקלי)\": \"4.33% 3 שנים\". That sounds like money, shekels, quiet. Is that 4% a year? It's similar to a deposit.\n- \"עוד לא דווח\" with an orange exclamation mark. Something isn't reported? That makes me nervous.\n- Screen 3: \"מיטב\", \"כספי (שקלי) 4.41%\". Again around 4%.\n- Screen 4: \"אלטשולר שחם\" and \"הפניקס\". I've heard those names on the news. Still endless rows, all the same.\n- Screen 5: \"ילין לפידות\", \"אג\"ח ממשלות 4.01% 3 שנים, 1.55% 5 שנים\". Why is it lower over 5 years? And \"מגדל\" has a lot of \"עוד לא דווח\".\n- That's it, my eyes hurt. I'm stopping.\n\n---\n\n**What I'd tell my son**\n\n\"Look, I didn't decide anything. I'm not opening anything until we talk, you and me, and maybe the bank too.\n\nI looked at a dark page with all the companies: הראל, מור, מיטב, אלטשולר, הפניקס, ילין, מגדל. My bank isn't there at all. Each company has a dozen or more tracks. The fees all look alike to me, a bit over half a percent, '0.54%' up to '0.73%'. I didn't understand whether that's more or less than what the bank takes from me.\n\nThe only thing that looked like it might be for me is 'כספי (שקלי)', and maybe 'אג\"ח ממשלות'. Those show about 4 to 4.5% next to '3 שנים'. I'm not sure whether that's per year or for all three years. There's a little circle next to them that I didn't understand. The tracks with shares show 20% and more, but that's the kind of thing that falls, and I've already been through that.\n\nI read about five screens and stopped. The page kept going, but I didn't.\n\nThings I didn't understand: 'עוקב מדד', 's&p 500', 'מט\"ח', 'סחיר', 'משולב', the yellow and turquoise circles, the dotted underlines under the numbers, 'עוד לא דווח' with the orange mark, and 'פחות מ־3 שנים' where a number should be. The line 'נכסים 19.1 מיליארד' I just skipped.\n\nWhat bothered me most: the whole thing is black with grey letters, too many numbers, and every company looks the same. And the box at the top says the figures haven't been updated since September.\""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3546,"cache_read_input_tokens":18305,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3546},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"85b1c2ed-7de2-444c-875d-d47001fa07ee","uuid":"b18d068c-f6dc-4e5f-8100-5dd07fc8d77d","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:20:32.167Z","request_id":"req_011CgkshL4RK6PRvtRnaWrnn"}
